### Issue 6: Inconsistent Field Access Modifiers

Hippopotamus has:
```java
private HashSet<Class> foodSources;      // INSTANCE field
private static HashSet<Class> killable;   // STATIC field
```

All other animals have both as static fields. This inconsistency will cause bugs.

